Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:04.20,SevenCloudsIntro,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}gnash - i hate u, i love u (Lyrics)\Nft. olivia o'brien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:08.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Feeling used, but I'm\nStill missing you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}And I can't see the end of this\nJust wanna feel your kiss against my lips
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:18.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}And now all this time is passing by\nBut I still can't seem to tell you why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:23.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}It hurts me every time I see you\nRealize how much I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:28.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you\nI hate that I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Don't want to, but I can't put\nNobody else above you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:39.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you\nI hate that I want you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:44.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}You want her, you need her\nAnd I'll never be her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:52.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I miss you when I can't sleep\nOr right after coffee, or right when I can't eat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:58.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I miss you in my front seat\nStill got sand in my sweaters from nights we don't remember
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:03.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Do you miss me like I miss you?\nFucked around and got attached to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:08.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Friends can break your heart too, and\nI'm always tired but never of you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:13.60,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}If I pulled a you on you, you wouldn't like that shit\nI put this reel out, but you wouldn't bite that shit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:18.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I type a text but then I never mind that shit\nI got these feelings but you never mind that shit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:24.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Oh oh, keep it on the low\nYou're still in love with me but your friends don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:29.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}If you wanted me you would just say so\nAnd if I were you, I would never let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:34.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I don't mean no harm\nI just miss you on my arm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:39.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Wedding bells were just alarms\nCaution tape around my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:45.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}You ever wonder what we could've been?\nYou said you wouldn't and you fucking did
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:50.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Lie to me, lie with me, get your fucking fix\nNow all my drinks and all my feelings are all fucking mixed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:55.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Always missing people that I shouldn't be missing\nSometimes you gotta burn some bridges just to create some distance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:02:00.60,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I know that I control my thoughts, and I should stop reminiscing\nBut I learned from my dad that it's good to have feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:05.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}When love and trust are gone\nI guess this is moving on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:10.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Everyone I do right does me wrong\nSo every lonely night, I sing this song
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.80,0:02:16.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you\nI hate that I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.10,0:02:21.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Don't want to, but I can't put\nNobody else above you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:26.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you\nI hate that I want you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:31.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}You want her, you need her\nAnd I'll never be her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:44.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}All alone I watch you watch her\nLike she's the only girl you've ever seen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:54.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}You don't care, you never did\nYou don't give a damn about me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:03:05.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Yeah, all alone I watch you watch her\nShe's the only thing you've ever seen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:16.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}How is it you never notice\nThat you are slowly killing me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:23.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you\nI hate that I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:28.80,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Don't want to, but I can't put\nNobody else above you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:34.00,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I hate you, I love you\nI hate that I want you
